{
  "id": 8860456616135,
  "title": "Personalized Vintage Reading Girl with Flowers Throw Blanket - Book",
  "handle": "personalized-vintage-reading-girl-with-flowers-throw-blanket-book",
  "body_html": "<p>Indulge the book lover in your life with this beautifully designed, personalized throw blanket from Jeminise. It's the perfect way to add warmth and style to any reading nook, making every cozy moment even more special.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Gift:</strong> A thoughtful and personal present for any book enthusiast, perfect for showcasing their passion for reading.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Make this blanket truly one-of-a-kind by adding personal details such as skin color, hairstyle, and name.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) to find the perfect fit for ultimate comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal present for special occasions like birthdays, Christmas, or simply as a heartfelt surprise for a fellow reader.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort and Style:</strong> This personalized blanket combines warmth with an appealing design, enhancing any book lover's space.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from soft and durable Polyester, providing a cozy feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This blanket is machine washable for convenient and simple cleaning.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Book Lover Blanket 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Book</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Medium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
